---
description: Rules for the Node packages
globs: ["node/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- TypeScript `strict`. ESM source. Build ESM + CJS with types.
- `node/packages/core` has `"dependencies": {}`. Adapters use `peerDependencies` for their framework.
- One op per file in `node/packages/core/src/ops/`, one test file per op.
- Converters are pure: no I/O, clock, or randomness. Dev mode deep-freezes their input.
- Public API changes update `etc/apiversa.api.md` (api-extractor) and `CHANGELOG.md` in the same commit.
- Fast check: `cd node && npm run lint && npm run typecheck && npm test`.
